    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d187-a2">

                <pb facs="0281" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg197"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Colombia, Senate Chamber, Office of the Secretary</hi>, No.
                                116,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                13, 1903</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs:</hi></p>
                <p>In compliance with article 322 of the Senate rules. I have the honor to inform
                    your excellency that this body, in yesterday’s session, rejected on first debate
                    the project of law “by which the treaty (signed in Washington on January 22,
                    1903) for the opening of the Panama Canal is approved.”</p>
                <p>God preserve your excellency.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Miguel A.
                    Peñaredonda.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
